# PM2 Restart Reminder

When making many changes in one session, periodically restart PM2 services before validating tests or reporting status.

- Use exact process names: `litreview-api`, `litreview-ui`, `litreview-tunnel`.
- Quick restart: `make pm2-restart` or `./scripts/ops_pm2.sh restart` (backend default), `make pm2-restart -- --prod-ui` or `ops_pm2.sh restart --prod-ui` (build + api), `ops_pm2.sh restart --all`.
- After backend `src/` changes: `make pm2-restart` or `pm2 restart litreview-api`.
- After frontend changes that must reflect on production URL: `make pm2-restart -- --prod-ui`.
- Before claiming local/online verification, run `pm2 list` and confirm required processes are online.
